## Optional: smaller APK per CPU (split ABIs)

One APK per architecture (smaller files; pick the one that matches the phone):

```powershell
cd "C:\Users\Kent Veloso\Desktop\DEV PROJECTS\dyd2026"
$env:Path = "C:\flutter\bin;$env:Path"
$env:JAVA_HOME = "C:\Program Files\Microsoft\jdk-17.0.19.10-hotspot"

flutter pub get
flutter build apk --release --split-per-abi
```

Outputs (typical):

- `build\app\outputs\flutter-apk\app-armeabi-v7a-release.apk` (older 32-bit ARM)
- `build\app\outputs\flutter-apk\app-arm64-v8a-release.apk` (most modern phones)
- `build\app\outputs\flutter-apk\app-x86_64-release.apk` (emulators)

