## Install the APK on a phone

**Without USB (share file):**

1. Copy `app-release.apk` to the phone (Drive, email, messaging, etc.).
2. Open the file on the phone and tap Install.
3. Allow “Install unknown apps” for that app if Android asks.

**With USB (ADB):**

```powershell
$adb = "$env:LOCALAPPDATA\Android\Sdk\platform-tools\adb.exe"
& $adb install -r "C:\Users\Kent Veloso\Desktop\DEV PROJECTS\dyd2026\build\app\outputs\flutter-apk\app-release.apk"
```

(`-r` reinstalls over an existing install.)

