## If the build fails

Run diagnostics and fix what `doctor` reports:

```powershell
$env:Path = "C:\flutter\bin;$env:Path"
$env:JAVA_HOME = "C:\Program Files\Microsoft\jdk-17.0.19.10-hotspot"
flutter doctor -v
```

Common fixes:

- **JDK not found** — set `JAVA_HOME` to JDK 17 (see blocks above).
- **Android licenses** — `flutter doctor --android-licenses`
- **Gradle / SDK** — open Android Studio once and install SDK Platform + Build-Tools for your Flutter version.

Clean rebuild:

```powershell
cd "C:\Users\Kent Veloso\Desktop\DEV PROJECTS\dyd2026"
flutter clean
flutter pub get
flutter build apk --release
```

